    "Synthetic example network; all values are illustrative test data from PyPSA.",
    "lines.length_km is null: the source stores PyPSA's default length 0 for every line.",
    "AC lines '0', '1', '5', '6' have r_ohm = 0 (reactance only); lines '2', '3', '4' join the DC buses and have x_ohm = 0 (resistance only, as PyPSA's DC power flow uses r). All lines carry carrier 'AC' in the source; values are kept unchanged.",
